    "Recognized Wi-Fi, login, eSIM, contact, calendar and communication codes stay on this iPhone. A photo is not sent if we find a private code or cannot check it reliably. The app sends no GPS location.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recognized Wi-Fi, login, eSIM, contact, calendar and communication codes stay on this iPhone. A photo is not sent if we find a private code or cannot check it reliably. The app sends no GPS location."
          }
        },
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rozpoznané kódy pro Wi-Fi, přihlášení, eSIM, kontakty, kalendář a komunikaci zůstávají v iPhonu. Fotku neodešleme, pokud najdeme soukromý kód nebo ji nemůžeme spolehlivě prověřit. Aplikace neodesílá polohu z GPS."
