    "With your permission, Safe QR sends the code contents, type, language, device score and warning identifiers. Photo checks also send a photo and the code’s position in it. Payment codes may include the recipient and amount.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With your permission, Safe QR sends the code contents, type, language, device score and warning identifiers. Photo checks also send a photo and the code’s position in it. Payment codes may include the recipient and amount."
          }
        },
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "S vaším souhlasem Safe QR odešle obsah a typ kódu, jazyk, skóre z telefonu a označení varování. Kontrola fotky odešle i fotku a polohu kódu v ní. Platební kódy mohou obsahovat příjemce a částku."
          }
        }
      }
    },
